# F450 quad-X, matching the built aircraft (see docs/architecture.html section 01).
# Layered on top of the binary's embedded frame defaults at every launch, so an
# isolated per-vehicle EEPROM still comes up armable.
#
# FRAME_CLASS/FRAME_TYPE cannot be changed over MAVLink without a reboot, which
# is why these are passed at launch rather than set by a script.
FRAME_CLASS      1
FRAME_TYPE       1
BATT_MONITOR     4
SIM_BATT_VOLTAGE 16.2
